  "notes": "USAGE: {破産|はさん} refers to personal bankruptcy. For corporate bankruptcy, ⟦{倒産|とうさん}→倒産：03452_tousan⟧ is more commonly used, though {破産|はさん} can apply to both.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {破産|はさん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to go bankrupt)\n- {破産|はさん}⟦{申請|しんせい}→申請：04207_shinsei⟧ (bankruptcy filing)\n- {破産|はさん}⟦{宣告|せんこく}→宣告：06819_senkoku⟧ (bankruptcy declaration)\n- {破産|はさん}⟦{手続|てつづ}き→手続き：05453_tetsuzuki⟧ (bankruptcy proceedings)\n- ⟦{自己|じこ}→自己：23357_jiko⟧{破産|はさん} (personal bankruptcy)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {破産|はさん} - bankruptcy (legal term, often personal)\n- ⟦{倒産|とうさん}→倒産：03452_tousan⟧ - bankruptcy, collapse (business)\n- ⟦{経営破綻|けいえいはたん}→経営破綻：27268_keieihatan⟧ - business failure\n\nLEGAL NOTE: In Japan, ⟦{自己|じこ}→自己：23357_jiko⟧{破産|はさん} (personal bankruptcy) allows for debt discharge but has consequences including credit restrictions.",
